# White House alert ledger is append-only and id-deduped on read (build_whitehouse
# ._load_ledger keeps the last row per id), so the correct conflict resolution is a
# UNION of both sides — never "keep only mine". The hourly sentinel is the sole writer,
# but this guarantees no alert row can be silently dropped even on an unexpected
# concurrent push.
data/whitehouse/alerts.jsonl merge=union
